	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『スター・ウォーズ エピソード６／ジェダイの帰還』に登場する素顔のダース・ベイダーをTJFで立体化！",
			"• ルーク・スカイウォーカーとの激闘で損傷した右腕も再現。",
			"• 表情付きとヘルメット付きの頭部は、差し替えにより再現。",
			"• シールの貼りやすさを考慮した胸部パーツを新規造形で再現。",
			"• マントはポージングへの干渉が少ない軟質素材を採用。",
			"• ライトセイバーやハンドパーツなど豊富な付属パーツで劇中シーンを徹底再現できる。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The true-faced Darth Vader that appears in \"Star Wars Episode VI: Return of the Jedi\" is made into a three-dimensional figure with TJF!",
			"• The right arm damaged in the fierce battle with Luke Skywalker is also recreated.",
			"• Heads with expressions and helmets can be reproduced by replacement.",
			"• The chest part has been recreated with new modeling to make it easier to apply the seal.",
			"• The cloak is made of soft material that does not interfere with posing.",
			"• Scenes from the play can be thoroughly reproduced with a wide variety of accessory parts such as lightsabers and hand parts."
		]
	},
